                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5431/80: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Williamson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-10-20T12:00:00+01:00">October 20,
                        1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received October 20—8:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>41. Department’s 61, October 19, 6 p.m. Swiss Government has no objection to
                    plan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Williamson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
